    <string name="guide_1_t">Today\'s picks</string>
    <string name="guide_1_d">The home screen shows one random tip from each of the 4 groups. They refresh every 5 minutes, even if the app was closed.</string>
    <string name="guide_2_t">Search</string>
    <string name="guide_2_d">Type in the search bar to find any tip by title or keywords, with or without accents.</string>
    <string name="guide_3_t">Browse topics</string>
    <string name="guide_3_d">Open the menu (☰) to see 4 groups and 34 topics, then tap a topic to list its tips.</string>
    <string name="guide_4_t">Read and listen</string>
    <string name="guide_4_d">Each tip shows its title, evidence rating, plain-words summary, cost and benefit. Tap the speaker to hear it read aloud.</string>
    <string name="guide_5_t">Prices in your currency</string>
    <string name="guide_5_d">Prices in the book are in Chinese yuan. They are converted automatically to the currency of the language you choose.</string>
    <string name="guide_6_t">Favorites and settings</string>
    <string name="guide_6_d">Tap the heart to save tips. In Settings you can change language, light/dark mode and reading speed.</string>
    <string name="about_intro">Live Better is a reader app built from the Chinese book 高性价比人生指南 (How To Live Better).</string>
    <string name="about_changes">Changes made: only each tip\'s Title, Evidence rating, In plain words, Cost and Benefit are kept; other sections are omitted; text is reformatted for mobile; Chinese yuan amounts are converted to other currencies; text-to-speech and favorites were added. Not endorsed by the original authors.</string>
